  "description": "Pure-managed TLS 1.3 (RFC 8446) for .NET — client and server, sync and async, with no BCrypt/OpenSSL P/Invoke (a single BCryptGenRandom entropy import remains). Includes X25519MLKEM768 hybrid post-quantum key exchange (FIPS 203 ML-KEM-768), mTLS, PSK resumption, 0-RTT early data, HelloRetryRequest, ALPN, OCSP stapling, Encrypted Client Hello (RFC 9849), certificate compression (RFC 8879), and the GOST (RFC 9367) and Chinese SM (RFC 8998) national cipher suites. NativeAOT-friendly; zero transitive dependencies (all crypto is source-vendored).",
